<title>UK: Sal Oppenheim sets warrants on U.S. dollar/yen.</title>
<headline>Sal Oppenheim sets warrants on U.S. dollar/yen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sal Oppenheim &amp; Cie Kommanditgesellschaft auf Aktien has issued 19 tranches of American-style warrants, with 25 million warrants in each, on the U.S. dollar/yen exchange rate.</p>
<p>There are 10 tranches of call warrants and nine tranches of put warrants.</p>
<p>There is a paydate of June 2, 1997 and the warrants will be listed in Dusseldorf and Frankfurt.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
